+---
+version: 1
+slug: "index-md"
+primary_target: "content/index.md"
+related_targets: [".vitepress/theme/components/Home.vue"]
+---
+
+# Homepage surface
+
+- Scope: custom VitePress homepage at `content/index.md`, supported by Vue components.
+- Visitor mode: Persuade.
+- Audience: node operators evaluating or starting with Bitcoin Roots.
+- Job: understand the project, trust its consensus/policy boundary, and begin setup.
+- Primary action: Get started.
+- Proof: existing repository documentation and project identity only.
+- Constraint: source documentation content remains unchanged.
+
+## Direction contract
+
+**THESIS:** Independence is a visible signal path, not a generic software hero; refuse the usual logo-title-feature-card stack.
+
+**OWN-WORLD:** Plan ₿ warm canvas, civic navy structure, sky-blue lines, one scarce Bitcoin-gold signal, precise rounded panels, and compact technical labels.
+
+**STORY:** See the network-to-node path, understand consensus neutrality and conservative policy, choose Get started, then reach the complete documentation atlas.
+
+**FIRST VIEWPORT:** A calm asymmetric editorial field: proposition and primary action occupy the left; a large static verification statement occupies the right; a ruled four-step path runs from network to validation to policy to “your node.”
+
+**FORM:** “Signal to sovereignty,” position 7 in the ordered structural list; surface seed `bf5a0382`.
+
+**MOTION:** The hero does not animate. The supplied root-mark Lottie lazy-loads lower on the page, plays once when visualized, and becomes a static resolved mark; reduced motion skips playback.
+
+**FINISH:** unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, DESIGN.md, and every shipping raster carrying its provenance
